  "details": "You must be in VR for this error to occur. It does not occur on desktop.\n\n1. Open the Action Menu\n\n2. Go to Options at the top, then to Action Menu at the 8 o'clock position\n\n3. Enable \"On Hud\"\n\n4. Select the \"HUD Position\" option\n\nOnce this has been done, moving the joystick will do absolutely nothing at all and the HUD will often move somewhere very uncomfortably close to the edge of the screen that makes it hard to see.\n\nThis has been a bug for several versions, I just forgot to report it.",
